ir demon overlords!&quot; is the wrong kind of messed up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":281,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","user":"atamajakki","date":". 01-22-2015, 02:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-22T12:34:24-08:00","id":378271,"title":"","content":"They are not play female because they are Trans but because they are forced by a desperate society that thinks that's the only way they will survive. And they're figuring out that someone's been feeding them bull.<br /> <br /> Besides it's the same setting which brought us the joys of the 7th Generation, Voormas, the Tzimisce, Room 101 (Which we were told can also cover things as reassigning sex in the new VE tradbook), Cici (TM), Ghouls, vaccinations that kill you or turn you into a monster, DNA, WoD: Gypsies and so much more. <br /> <br /> Wu Keng are at least not a representation of actual Trans people, but something else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-25T20:35:53-08:00","id":381557,"title":"","content":"Book of Abominations: a one shot book explaining the origin of demons 